<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.4001 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.4001 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4001 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.5300 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 23		 June 20</p>
<p> High			     75.3530		 75.5300</p>
<p> Low				75.4001		 75.4402</p>
<p> Open			     75.4500		 75.4869</p>
<p> Close			    75.4001		 75.5300</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  0.855		   0.230</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
